Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:52:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Fix findings of the third fresh-copy verification

- multimodal_baseline.md: your own runs use a my_ prefix (step 3 and step 8), so the
  summary of the recorded 20261016_* runs is not mixed with them; step 8 shows both
  summaries.
- summarize_multimodal_runs --out refuses an existing file (README: never overwrite);
  the docstring writes a new file and compares it with the committed table.
- checkpoints.md 4.1: the Zhihan replay needs its own --out_dir; data/README.md notes
  that the two 20261001 image heads need --features_dir and --reference_metrics.
- api_spec.md / predictor.py: /model echoes the configured checkpoint path; only encoder
  folders are reduced to their names.
- Multimodal_Assets.md: the summary script skips reproduction/rerun names.
- Image_Cloud_Assets.csv: the verification archive comes from the image group's clean
  branch of the original team repository.
- Multimodal_Test_Results.md: the image train.sh example matches the shipped head's
  epoch, metrics and labels (probabilities within 3e-7), not byte for byte.
- .dockerignore excludes *.bin, *.onnx, *.h5 at any depth; .gitignore ignores *.bin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
